<https://kvinayakpai.github.io/domain-series/ontology/store-014#rule-5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every stock correction has a reason. Mirror-image corrections on lookalike items, neighboring slots or two buildings are one event."@en .
